{"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSRadioItem","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents13OUDSRadioItemV","platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iOS","beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"macOS","beta":false,"unavailable":false},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"16.0","deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","deprecated":false},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"watchOS","introducedAt":"11.0","deprecated":false}],"title":"OUDSRadioItem","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSRadioItem","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSRadioItem"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Controls"]},{"content":[{"text":"Layouts","type":"heading","anchor":"Layouts","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component can be rendered as two different layouts:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": the component has a leading indicator, a label and optional texts, and an optional trailing decorative icon","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"reversed"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": like the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" layout but with a trailing radio indicator and a leading optional decorative icon"}]}]}]},{"text":"Indicator states","anchor":"Indicator-states","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The radio indicator has two available states:"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"selected"}]},{"text":": the radio is filled with a filled circle, the user has made the action to select the radio","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"unselected"}]},{"text":": the radio is empty, does not contain anything, the user has made the action to unselect or did not select yet the radio","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Particular cases","anchor":"Particular-cases","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadioItem"},{"type":"text","text":" can be related to an error situation, for example troubles for a form."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A dedicated look and feel is implemented for that if the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"isError"},{"type":"text","text":" flag is risen."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"In that case if the component displayed an icon, this icon will be replaced automatically by an error icon."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In addition, the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadioItem"},{"type":"text","text":" can be in read only mode, i.e. the user cannot interact with the component yet but this component must not be considered"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as disabled."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The radio can be also outlined in some cases."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The component does not follow the right-to-left (RTL) \/ left-to-right (LTR) mode returned by the system as it could have some meaning"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to have for example the indicator in trailing position for LTR mode and vice versa."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However, if the component has an icon in leading position (RTL mode) or in trailing position (LTR), the content of the icon is never changed."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It could lead to a loss of meaning or semantics in the icon. Thus the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSImage"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"flipped"},{"type":"text","text":" property can be used to flip the icon content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whatever the layout direction is, preventing the user from implementing their own rules to flip or not the image."}]},{"text":"Rich text","anchor":"Rich-text","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich text can only be used for error messages."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The error message is an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextualContent"},{"type":"text","text":": a raw "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"type":"text","text":", a localized string with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".localized(_:tableName:bundle:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or a rich text with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".rich(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" and an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AttributedString"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Prefer "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".raw(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" to a bare string literal for a raw message, so the compiler selects without any doubt the initializer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"taking an "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSTextualContent"},{"type":"text","text":" and does not emit a deprecation warning."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Strong text can be used sparingly to highlight key information within the content."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"No other text styles should be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Underlined text must not be applied manually (e.g. in error message), as it is commonly associated with hyperlinks and may mislead users."}]},{"text":"Accessibility considerations","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Always check the results of rich text mode with high contrast, light and dark modes, and Voice Over vocalization."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Voice Over"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" will use several elements to describe the component: if component disabled \/ read only, if error context, the label and optional texts and a custom radio trait."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"No accessibility identifier is defined in OUDS side as this value remains in the users hands."}]},{"text":"Forbidden by design","anchor":"Forbidden-by-design","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have both an error situation and a read only component."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have both an error situation and a disabled component."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The design system does not allow to have both a read only and a disabled component."}],"type":"strong"}]},{"text":"Code samples","anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadioItem"},{"type":"text","text":" can be used outside a dedicated picker, thus it does not need any tag and associated type."}]},{"code":["    \/\/ Supposing we have an unselected state","    @Published var selection: Bool = false","","    \/\/ A leading radio with a label.","    OUDSRadioItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\", isOn: $selection)","","    \/\/ Localizable from bundle can also be used","    OUDSRadioItem(LocalizedStringKey(\"option_label\"), bundle: Bundle.module, isOn: $selection)","","    \/\/ A leading radio with a label, but in read only mode (user cannot interact yet, but not disabled).","    OUDSRadioItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\", isOn: $selection, isReadOnly: true)","","    \/\/ A leading radio with an additional label and a description.","    OUDSRadioItem(\"Lucy in the Sky with Diamonds\", isOn: $selection,","                  extraLabel: \"The Beatles\", description: \"1967\")","","    \/\/ A trailing radio with a label, a description, a tinted icon, a divider and an error.","    OUDSRadioItem(\"Rescue from this world!\",","                  isOn: $selection,","                  description: \"Put your hand in mine\",","                  image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\")),","                  isReversed: true,","                  isError: true,","                  hasDivider: true)","","    \/\/ A trailing radio with a raw (non-tinted) image.","    OUDSRadioItem(\"Rescue from this world!\",","                  isOn: $selection,","                  description: \"Put your hand in mine\",","                  image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(decorative: \"il_someImage\"), renderingMode: .original),","                  isReversed: true,","                  isError: true,","                  hasDivider: true)","","    \/\/ Flip the icon for RTL layouts using OUDSImage.","    OUDSRadioItem(\"Cocorico !\",","                  isOn: $selection,","                  image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"figure.handball\"),","                                  flipped: layoutDirection == .rightToLeft),","                  isReversed: layoutDirection == .rightToLeft)","","    \/\/ If on error, add an error message can help user to understand error context","    OUDSRadioItem(\"Rescue from this world!\",","                  isOn: $selection,","                  isError: true,","                  errorText: .raw(\"Something wrong\"),","                  hasDivider: true)","","    \/\/ The error message is an OUDSTextualContent: raw, localized or rich text","    OUDSRadioItem(\"Rescue from this world!\",","                  isOn: $selection,","                  isError: true,","                  errorText: .localized(\"error_wording\", bundle: Bundle.module))","    OUDSRadioItem(\"Rescue from this world!\",","                  isOn: $selection,","                  isError: true,","                  errorText: .rich(AttributedString(markdown: \"Please select **one flavor**\"))) \/\/ Manage in your side errors for init","","    \/\/ A leading radio with a label, but disabled.","    OUDSRadioItem(\"Rescue from this world!\", isOn: $selection)","        .disabled(true)","","    \/\/ Never disable a read only or an error-related radio as it will crash","    \/\/ This is forbidden by design!","    OUDSRadioItem(\"Kaboom!\", isOn: $selection, isError: true).disabled(true) \/\/ fatal error","    OUDSRadioItem(\"Kaboom!\", isOn: $selection, isReadOnly: true).disabled(true) \/\/ fatal error"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Design documentation","anchor":"Design-documentation","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-radio-button"}]},{"text":"Themes rendering","anchor":"Themes-rendering","type":"heading","level":2},{"text":"Orange","anchor":"Orange","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_radioItem_Orange"}]},{"text":"Orange Compact","anchor":"Orange-Compact","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_radioItem_OrangeCompact"}]},{"text":"Sosh","anchor":"Sosh","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_radioItem_Sosh"}]},{"text":"Wireframe","anchor":"Wireframe","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_radioItem_Wireframe"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Version","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.4.0 (Figma component design version)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Since","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0.12.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSRadioItem","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"text":"Radio button item is a UI element that allows to select a single option from a set of mutually exclusive choices.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Radio button item covers a wider range of contexts by allowing to toggle the visibility of additional text labels and icon assets.","type":"text"}],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/